		|threadBody|Thread Reply Body|
		|threadSubject|Thread Subject|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread goto CP
		|threadSubject|Thread Subject|
	And MessageboardsThread view Reply CP
		|postsNumber|2|
		|threadBody|Thread Body|
		|threadBody2|Thread Reply Body|
		|threadSubject|Thread Subject|
		|userName|Test Test|
